<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" kicker="Privacy" description="How Musebox AI Video Guide handles visits and personal information on this static independent publication."><h2>Summary</h2><p>This is a static content website. It has no user accounts, video generator, image upload, payment flow, comments, or visitor profile database.</p><h2>Technical request data</h2><p>Our hosting and security provider may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>No media collection</h2><p>We do not accept or store prompts, source images, generated videos, identification documents, or project files. Do not send sensitive media through public correction channels.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Official product and reference links lead to third-party websites governed by their own policies. Review those policies before registering, uploading, generating, sharing, or paying.</p><h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2><p>With your permission, we use Google Analytics 4 to measure page visits, scrolling, outbound link clicks, device information, and referral sources. Analytics cookies help distinguish visits. Google may process this data on servers outside your country. We do not enable Google signals, advertising personalization, or advertising cookies.</p><p>Analytics is off until you choose Allow analytics. Choose No thanks to decline, or use Analytics preferences at the bottom of any page to withdraw permission and remove this site's accessible Google Analytics cookies. We remember your preference in local storage for up to 180 days, and honor Global Privacy Control and Do Not Track browser signals. We remove query strings and fragments from the page URL passed in our Google tag configuration and do not send chat messages, prompts, uploads, or contact-form contents.</p><p>Analytics cookies are configured to expire after 180 days, subject to renewal when used. Clearing cookies does not erase historical data already processed by Google. For information about Google's handling of analytics data, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. You may also use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p></InfoPage>
